    {
      "id": "b4b9fe4f-1702-433a-a501-048bcbbee1ce",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -420,
        -160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 5,
        "width": 420,
        "height": 560,
        "content": "## Log LINE OA messages to Google Sheets + auto-reply\n\n**What it does**\nReceives LINE Official Account webhook events, checks the LINE signature, saves every text message (time, user ID, display name, text, reply token) to a Google Sheet, and sends a short automatic reply.\n\n**Setup (about 10 minutes)**\n1. In LINE Developers console, open your Messaging API channel. Copy the **Channel secret** and issue a **Channel access token (long-lived)**.\n2. In n8n create a **Header Auth** credential named `LINE Channel Access Token`: Name `Authorization`, Value `Bearer YOUR_TOKEN`. Select it in both HTTP Request nodes.\n3. Paste the Channel secret into the **Verify LINE Signature** node (or leave empty to skip the check while testing).\n4. Make a Google Sheet with the header row `timestamp, userId, displayName, message, replyToken`. Connect Google Sheets and pick the file in **Append Row to Google Sheet**.\n5. Activate the workflow, copy the **Production URL** from **LINE Webhook** and paste it as the Webhook URL in LINE (Messaging API tab). Turn on **Use webhook** and click **Verify**.\n6. Edit the reply text in **Send LINE Auto-Reply**."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "c886fb48-ab17-43c8-a09c-3ec10b5faf44",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Security",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        160,
        40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 6,
        "width": 420,
        "height": 220,
        "content": "### Signature check\nLINE signs each request with HMAC-SHA256 using your Channel secret. Invalid requests get a 401 and stop here. LINE expects a fast 200, so the workflow answers right after the check and keeps processing."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "5f8c8030-84ed-450f-a20c-8f9f00ad4a06",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Logging",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1060,
        -60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 660,
        "height": 220,
        "content": "### Log and reply\nOnly `message` events of type `text` continue. The profile lookup adds the display name (it is left blank if the user has not added your OA as a friend). The reply token works once and expires shortly, so the reply is sent right after logging."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    }
